pps/4512850/extras/2fdb221e5d7bc3cb64e8d411610c469a.mp4?t=1773902252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore the seedy underbelly of the city and uncover secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >work or scavenge to get food and gold coins to pay your rent or die and try again</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >use your trusty net or fishing rod to collect feral critters, and sell them to the local aquarium museum. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect knick-knacks &amp; stamps and fill out your encyclopedia!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512850/extras/7947d5e5b1015c21cd618338866d7a99.poster.avif?t=1773902252\" width=540 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512850/extras/7947d5e5b1015c21cd618338866d7a99.webm?t=1773902252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512850/extras/7947d5e5b1015c21cd618338866d7a99.mp4?t=1773902252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >go crazy!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw &amp; play as a toon in a toybox city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >draw &amp; paint your own procedural animated toon homunculus. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512850/extras/7600e428aeed897d9538065cb7c123cd.poster.avif?t=1773902252\" width=320 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512850/extras/7600e428aeed897d9538065cb7c123cd.webm?t=1773902252\" type=\"video/webm; 